            "resource": "fraction-split-degree",
            "note": "本题 $m^2=\\frac{1-n^4}{5n^2}=\\frac1{5n^2}-\\frac{n^2}5$，加上 $n^2$ 得 $m^2+n^2=\\frac1{5n^2}+\\frac{4n^2}5$。"
          },
          "title": "分式分离",
          "position": 2
        },
        "structure": {
          "refs": [
